              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwape ejaar akwap, arai naapusuk arai naakurae, arai ejaas amagoron, arai emameete, Kotitinikis yesi, koyauniata da adioraito nuka akwap.” Kerai na apak naka imusabibun luageenenete atiokore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
