              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kodokasi kari naka Eŋalakimak, kodoloto Keburon; ajaas nen Akiman, Sesai ka Talimai, idwe luka Anak. (Adukitai Keburon ikar ikanykaarei eroko Soan kotoma Misiri.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
