        },
        {
          "text": " Kisililin Kaleb ituŋa kakonyen nuka Musa, kotema atiar, “Kadokasi katipet, keruma ŋes; naarai kipedori eut aipikor.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.30",
