            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koinut idwe luka Isirael akiro nueroko nuka akwap naapotu korota, ebe, “Akwap nakitoro kirosi, erai akwap naenyamanari luibojete kotoma; ituŋa da lukipou kaanyutu kotoma eraas ituŋa luikososoete, ",
